gcXp(){return"Copy the issued memory ID and paste it back into Hesabix."},
gcXw(){return"4) Complete the connection form in Hesabix"},
gcXv(){return"Tax memory ID, economic code and private key are mandatory under the Connection tab."},
gcXs(){return"Enter the ID and economic code without extra spaces."},
gcXt(){return"Use Generate new keys to create private key, public key, and CSR; register the CSR with your CA and save the issued certificate (.crt) here."},
gcXu(){return"Enable sandbox mode only for staging/testing environments."},
gcXB(){return"5) Request the intermediate certificate via CSR"},
gcXA(){return"Legal entities must submit the CSR to the national certificate authority."},
gcXx(){return"Visit gica.ir and choose the CSR-based request option."},
gcXy(){return"Fill in the company details and pay the issuance fee."},
gcXz(){return"After in-person verification upload the issued certificate into Hesabix."},
gcXG(){return"6) Assign product/service tax codes"},
gcXF(){return"Invoices will be rejected if items lack tax code and unit."},
